<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHANA Cayuk Akthumnak</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHANA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cayuk Akthumnak</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Johana Cayuk Akthumnak </char> hin Sangcim khawng Kajas ngmingnakia veia “Axüngvai” naw a yuka kyaki. Kcak’yu naw Khritjane a jah kpüikpaka phäh jenak a mthehnak ni. Acunkäna, amät naw amät sangcim khawnga mcawnei lü sangcima pyüpyenak vai pawhki Tajawtajah ngmingnaki a mceiei vaia kca yuki naw mthehsihki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:1-4">1-4</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kajas a mküieinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:5-8">5-8</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tajawtajah a mkateinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:9-10">9-10</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Timitilih a mküieinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:11-12">11-12</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khüpnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:13-15">13-15</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1"/>Kei Angvai naw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ngs 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Kor 1:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Ka mhläkphyanak kcang Kajasa veia.<verse eid="3JN 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2"/>Ka püi aw, nang cun ngmüimkhya üng na hlimtuiki tia ka ksingki. Anaküt üng dawkyanak yah lü pumsa phyawngyainak am na kümcei vaia ka ning ktaiyü petki. <verse eid="3JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3"/>Ngthukcang üng aläa nami xüngseia mäih, ngthukcang üng hlimtui lü na sitiha mawng mi khritjanpüi he naw na mtheh law u se ka ngjak üng aktäa ka jekyaiki. <verse eid="3JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4"/>Ka canae ngthukcang üng ami hlimtui ka ngjak üng ka jekyaia kba, i naw pi am na jekyaisak khawh.<verse eid="3JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kajas mküieinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5"/>Ka mhlänaka ka püi aw, nang cun jumeikiea phäh khut na binak üng sitih lü khinea ami thawn üng pi na sitihki. <verse eid="3JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6"/>Na mhläkphyanaka mawng cun sangcima maa pyen päng ve u. Ami kdunglawngnak üng jah kpüikpak betü lü Pamhnam jekyaisakia khut na pawh vaia ning nghui na veng. <verse eid="3JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7"/>Isenitiüng, amimi cun naw am jumeikie veia i pi käh doei lü, Khritawa khuta phäh cit hükie ni. <verse eid="3JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8"/>Acunakyase, ami khutbi cun mi jah bipüikiea a kyak vaia, mimi khritjane naw acuna khyange cun mi jah kpüikpak kawm u.<verse eid="3JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tajawtajah ja Timitilih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9"/>Sangcima veia kca aktawia ka yuk law kyaw. Cunüngpi, ami mkhawng vai sü kyaw Tajawtajah naw ka pyen am na hnaläüei. <verse eid="3JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10"/>Acunakyase, ka lawa kcün üng, a pawh naküt: a hleihlake ja am dawkyakia a jah pyennake cun sangcima maa ka phyeh law be khai. Acun däk am ni, khritjane ami law üng am jah dodang. Jah dodang hlükie pi jah mah ham lü sangcim üngkhyüh jah ksät vaia ngtängki.<verse eid="3JN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11"/>Ka mhlänak ka püi he aw, aksea thawnki käh mcukei ua, akdawa thawnki mcukei ua. Au pi akdaw pawhki cun Pamhnam üng sängeikie ni. Au pi akse pawhkie naw Pamhnam am ksing u.<verse eid="3JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12"/>Khyang lum naw Dematarih dawki ami ti. Kami pyen cangki ti nami ksingnak vaia kami saksisihki ni.<verse eid="3JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnak ngthu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13"/>Ka ning jah mtheh vai daki kyaw, Pawpen ja hmen üng am yuk hlü ngü. <verse eid="3JN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14"/>Sängsäng se ning jah hmuh law vaia ka ngaiki. Acun üng mi püi hmu lü mi ngthuhei be kawm u. Acunüng, akhyang puma mi ngthuei law khaie.<verse eid="3JN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15"/>Dimdeihnak nami khana be se. Ka püi avan naw pi yai u se ami ti. Mi püi he avan ka jah hnuksetki.<verse eid="3JN 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1"/>
</usx>
